---
title: Lefse
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Bread of Life
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@potatoes, mashed{8%cups}
@butter{8%heaping Tbsp}
@whipping cream{1%cup}
@salt{1%Tbsp}
@flour

Mix and cool over night. In morning, add flour - more flour as you roll. 500 degrees on lefse grill.
